Package: reposhelf
Version: 0.1.0~beta1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt6, python3-pyqt6.qtwebengine, python3-keyring
Maintainer: RepoShelf contributors <reposhelf@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Local desktop package manager for iOS jailbreak repositories
 RepoShelf browses jailbreak package sources and downloads packages to a
 local library. This AI-generated software is an early beta release.
